  keywords   = {3D visual positioning, Cameras, Grasping, {LLM}, multimodal interactive robot, Object detection, odometer coordinate compensation, Odometers, Operating systems, Robot kinematics, Robot vision systems, Robots, Target recognition, Visualization, {YOLOv}8 target detection},
